(718, 'BrianExoro', 'me2@topcrush.org', '89165949183', 'https://astronaut-game-online.org', NULL, 'Astronaut Crash crash game is a well-known multiplier game where the value grows until the crash. Many players talk about the approximate return to player near 97%. RTP means the expected return calculated across many rounds. However, it does not guarantee short-term results. \n \nIn games like this, players often decide the moment to stop the round. Some players prefer small exit multipliers, while others wait for higher multipliers. Each approach has risks. Because the outcome is determined by the game system, wins and losses can happen in any session. \n \nFor that reason, responsible play is recommended. Knowing the mechanics of crash games can help players better understand the experience. Game link: https://astronaut-game-online.org', NULL, 'unread', '2026-03-18 13:54:29', '2026-03-18 13:54:29'),
