(12, 'Deva Center', '<div style=\"margin:0 auto;max-width:1200px;\"><h3 class=\"tittle\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,51,102);font-family:\'Electrolize-Regular\';font-size:2.8em;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.1;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:10px 0px;text-align:center;word-spacing:0px;\"><u>Deva Center</u></h3><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;\" src=\"https://disccindia.org/storage/0999.jpg\" alt=\"0999.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\"></figure><figure class=\"image\">&nbsp;</figure><p style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"border-style:none;font-family:inherit, serif;font-size:18pt;padding:0in;\"><strong>Deva International Society for Child Care (DISCC)</strong>,</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:Calibri, \'sans-serif\';\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:17px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, \'sans-serif\';\">Varanasi is a registered NGO from 28&nbsp;years. Established in 1991 its main focus is to help children and Families from various childhood Mental, Physical and emotional problems and to train parents in effective parenting skills and Technique. Also to sensitize and train government, Semi Govt. and private organizations and officers in prevention of child abuse, trafficking and various other Mental health problems such as disabilities among children and to rehabilitate such victims. Since last 28 years the organization has won many awards and felicitations even from Prime Minister Mr. Narendra Modi for its services in the field of child psychiatric problems. The institution Deva Center caters to the needs of UP, Bihar, Nepal and it is 1st in Varanasi to do such services. It is well connected Nationally and Internationally&nbsp;with USA, France, Holland, Dubai, Re- Union Island, and has all the transparencies&nbsp;and accountabilities in its ventures. &nbsp;Dr. Tulsi is the chief Psychologist, Counselor and Psychotherapist and founder President of this organization. Last but not the least, The project SAAHAS&nbsp;with Police services of UP is the result of this organization.&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:17px;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p></div>', 1, NULL, 'page-detail', '', 'published', '2024-11-20 17:34:08', '2026-03-24 09:22:12'),
(13, 'Annapurna Center', '<div style=\"margin:0 auto;max-width:1200px;\"><h3 class=\"tittle\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,51,102);font-family:\'Electrolize-Regular\';font-size:2.8em;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.1;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:10px 0px;text-align:center;word-spacing:0px;\"><u>Annapurna Center</u></h3><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:960/720;\" src=\"https://disccindia.org/storage/0888-copy.jpg\" alt=\"0888-copy.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\"></figure><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\', Times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt;\">Annapurna Center Situated at about 13 km from, VARANASI City,&nbsp; “Annapurna Center” is the second project of \"DISCC\". This center was established in <strong>1995</strong> to cater to the needs of poor, rural women and the girl child. The main objective of this rural social club is to make these women and girls confident in their own self, to make them understand about preventive and promotive aspects of health and to train them in some culturally tailored vocational activities, At present there are twenty girls and married women who come at the social club and learn various social activities .The center is managed by an Educated women from the same village.</span> &nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18pt;\">&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\', serif;font-size:18pt;\">Cultural program, Health Camps, Skill-Training workshops etc. are organised from time to time for their benefit&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\', Times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:\'Times New Roman\', Times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p></div>', 1, NULL, 'page-detail', '', 'published', '2024-11-20 17:34:08', '2026-03-24 09:24:22');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `name`, `content`, `user_id`, `image`, `template`, `description`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(14, 'Help Line', '<div style=\"margin:0 auto;max-width:1200px;\"><h3 class=\"tittle\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,51,102);font-family:\'Electrolize-Regular\';font-size:2.8em;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.1;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:10px 0px;text-align:center;word-spacing:0px;\"><u>Help Line</u></h3><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:900/600;\" src=\"https://disccindia.org/storage/0333-copy.jpg\" alt=\"0333-copy.jpg\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\"></figure><p><a class=\"news\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,51,102);font-family:\'Electrolize-Regular\';font-size:2em;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\" href=\"https://dev.disccindia.org/help-line\">Emergency Help to Children and Families</a></p><p class=\"style1\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;\">HELP LINE, as the name indicates, is meant for extending immediate medical, social,or emergency medical support to the family, who are unable to help themselves because of the poverty, or due to any other reason.&nbsp; Primarily, this help line extends helping hand to children in need but as the child cannot be separated from the family, if some thing goes wrong with the family, then also the family is supported and rehabilitated by the DISCC.</span></p><p class=\"style1\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;\">This kind of project in separate form came into our mind because we found that, there are some children, who don’t fit in to other category of project we are doing, but we also felt that, they need our help immediately. Also, if we don’t help them, then some kind of problem is going to come in their life in general. Keeping this objective in our mind, we designed this project.</span></p><p class=\"style1\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;\">Through, Help line project, we are able to help many children and also adults in getting rid of their medical problems, helped families in grave needs. There are many stories in this help line to be told.</span></p><p class=\"style1\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"style1\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;\">FUNDING</span></p><p class=\"style1\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;\">Most of the funding for the help line project comes from the Individual sponsorship programmes on the international level.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"Style1\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p></div>', 1, NULL, 'page-detail', '', 'published', '2024-11-20 17:34:08', '2026-03-24 09:09:40'),
(15, 'Child Education Program', '<div style=\"margin:0 auto;max-width:1200px;\"><h3 class=\"tittle\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,51,102);font-family:\'Electrolize-Regular\';font-size:2.8em;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.1;margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:10px 0px;text-align:center;word-spacing:0px;\"><u>Children Educational Program</u></h3><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:900/600;\" src=\"https://disccindia.org/storage/0777-copy.jpg\" alt=\"0777-copy.jpg\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\"></figure><p><br>&nbsp;<a class=\"news\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,51,102);font-family:\'Electrolize-Regular\';font-size:2em;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\" href=\"https://dev.disccindia.org/child-education-program\">A preparatory Center for providing Basic Education to Socially Deprived Children</a></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">Gangotri is the name of the place from where the Mother Ganges originates in Himalayas. This preparatory school is situated below a tree near the banks of river Ganges.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">The school provides education, confidence, health and hygiene skills to the kids who had no previous experience of any school. It mainly stresses on ‘Value Based Education’ through story telling and games and tries to bring the best in them. After looking at the motivational level of the top scorers and good students of the school in education, they are shifted to a better school .All the educational requirements including school fee, study material and school dresses are provided free of cost. Time to time, parents meeting are also held to motivate the parents.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:\'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0.5em 0px 0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p></div>', 1, NULL, 'page-detail', '', 'published', '2024-11-20 17:34:08', '2026-03-24 09:25:54'),
(16, 'Cookies', '<section class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"content-detail\">\n            <h3 class=\"color-brand-2\">EU Cookie Consent</h3>\n            <p class=\"font-md color-grey-900\">To use this website we are using Cookies and collecting some Data. To be compliant with the EU GDPR we give you to choose if you allow us to use certain Cookies and to collect some Data. .</p>\n            <p>There are two primary modes of sea freight transportation: Full Container Load (FCL) and Less than Container Load (LCL). FCL is used when the shipment is large enough to fill an entire container. On the other hand, LCL is used when the shipment does not require a full container. In this case, the goods are combined with other shipments to fill a container. Both modes have their advantages and disadvantages.</p>\n            <p>There are two primary modes of sea freight transportation: Full Container Load (FCL) and Less than Container Load (LCL). FCL is used when the shipment is large enough to fill an entire container. On the other hand, LCL is used when the shipment does not require a full container. In this case, the goods are combined with other shipments to fill a container. Both modes have their advantages and disadvantages.</p>\n            <h3>Essential Data</h3>\n            <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\n                    <p>The Essential Data is needed to run the Site you are visiting technically. You can not deactivate them.</p>\n                    <p>Session Cookie: PHP uses a Cookie to identify user sessions. Without this Cookie the Website is not working.</p>\n                    <p>XSRF-Token Cookie: Laravel automatically generates a CSRF \"token\" for each active user session managed by the application. This token is used to verify that the authenticated user is the one actually making the requests to the application.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', '2024-11-20 17:34:08', '2024-11-20 17:34:08'),
