(3, 'Cody Fisher', 'Their team is a valuable asset to our business operations. Gerow’s efficient service has saved us time and money.', 'testimonials/3.png', 'Foster &amp; Co.', 'published', '2024-11-20 17:34:09', '2024-11-20 17:34:09'),
